6,Austronesian Soundscapes: Performing Arts in Oceania and ... - JSTOR,https://www.jstor.org/stable/j.ctt46mvnd,"Austronesian Soundscapes is a collection of essays on Austronesian musics that transcends disciplinary frontiers in the humanities and social sciences. In all of Austronesia, music plays a crucial role in the negotiation of cultural identities; yet research on the diversity of the Austronesian cultural belt's music has hitherto been rather sparse.",Maisin,Austronesian
7,Austronesian Music - Music genre - Rate Your Music,https://rateyourmusic.com/genre/austronesian-music/,"Austronesian music nowadays refers to the ongoing evolution and fusion of various cultural influences from foreign and neighbouring cultures. These influences have over the centuries introduced new instruments, styles, and genres, blending age-old elements with newer traditions.",Maisin,Austronesian
